    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/362f1baac1a2faae37b77173935071fb.avif?t=1749880482\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are 'trapped' in the Labyrinth of Oblivion. <br><br>A dungeon created by your memories and you gradually lose your skills. <br><br>Will you be able to clear this labyrinth?</strong><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main System :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you start the game, you become a very powerful 'hero'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/2c871b1df4f7624fe388da5b6be7e233.avif?t=1749880482\" width=507 height=459 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have all the skills from the beginning, so you can easily clear any adversity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, isn't the game too easy? Unfortunately, this labyrinth is not easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/b718d85acfbfd040038a08406f82857a.avif?t=1749880482\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to advance, you have to dedicate your skills to the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, the labyrinth will create the appearance at the time when you obtained that skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can advance that much. However, the skills you dedicate in this way cannot be used in that play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, the game becomes more difficult as you advance. I wonder how many skills you will have left when you reach the end of this labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play :\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To clear the space created by the labyrinth, you must clear various conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/95190ff8935a57db8115f0538f26eb73.poster.avif?t=1749880482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/95190ff8935a57db8115f0538f26eb73.webm?t=1749880482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have to defeat enemies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/88669771d76da49b76222d3a14b51709.poster.avif?t=1749880482\" width=624 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/88669771d76da49b76222d3a14b51709.webm?t=1749880482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/88669771d76da49b76222d3a14b51709.mp4?t=1749880482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have to protect something,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/13232c0e234a5b187bba96e80ebc0ebb.poster.avif?t=1749880482\" width=624 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/13232c0e234a5b187bba96e80ebc0ebb.webm?t=1749880482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/13232c0e234a5b187bba96e80ebc0ebb.mp4?t=1749880482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry. As long as you have enough skills, you will clear it easily :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And... :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You headed to this labyrinth to become a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a young friend is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/7e438016498eea783b2c2c9ea83b661d.avif?t=1749880482\" width=304 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget this fact!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to meet this friend again at the end of your adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/362f1baac1a2faae37b77173935071fb.avif?t=1749880482\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are 'trapped' in the Labyrinth of Oblivion. <br><br>A dungeon created by your memories and you gradually lose your skills. <br><br>Will you be able to clear this labyrinth?</strong><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main System :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you start the game, you become a very powerful 'hero'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/2c871b1df4f7624fe388da5b6be7e233.avif?t=1749880482\" width=507 height=459 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have all the skills from the beginning, so you can easily clear any adversity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, isn't the game too easy? Unfortunately, this labyrinth is not easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/b718d85acfbfd040038a08406f82857a.avif?t=1749880482\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to advance, you have to dedicate your skills to the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, the labyrinth will create the appearance at the time when you obtained that skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can advance that much. However, the skills you dedicate in this way cannot be used in that play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, the game becomes more difficult as you advance. I wonder how many skills you will have left when you reach the end of this labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play :\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To clear the space created by the labyrinth, you must clear various conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/95190ff8935a57db8115f0538f26eb73.poster.avif?t=1749880482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/95190ff8935a57db8115f0538f26eb73.webm?t=1749880482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have to defeat enemies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/88669771d76da49b76222d3a14b51709.poster.avif?t=1749880482\" width=624 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/88669771d76da49b76222d3a14b51709.webm?t=1749880482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/88669771d76da49b76222d3a14b51709.mp4?t=1749880482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have to protect something,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/13232c0e234a5b187bba96e80ebc0ebb.poster.avif?t=1749880482\" width=624 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/13232c0e234a5b187bba96e80ebc0ebb.webm?t=1749880482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/13232c0e234a5b187bba96e80ebc0ebb.mp4?t=1749880482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry. As long as you have enough skills, you will clear it easily :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And... :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You headed to this labyrinth to become a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a young friend is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634810/extras/7e438016498eea783b2c2c9ea83b661d.avif?t=1749880482\" width=304 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget this fact!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to meet this friend again at the end of your adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
